 return 'Ryan AI timed out before completing a synthesized answer, so I am showing the retained P&ID facts that matched your question instead of losing the result.\n\n'+lines.join('\n')+'\n\nThese are retained DOCUMENT_EXTRACTED_UNVERIFIED facts. Ask a narrower tag/equipment question and Ryan will retrieve a smaller set.';
