 s+='<div style="font-size:10px;color:#5a6b7c;margin-top:10px;font-style:italic;">Baseline throw values are the real confirmed readings from the C-'+num+' rod load popup. 12EJ now scales them with current load step and pressure-derived gas-load index, and separately shows a normalized reversal margin. Exact intermediate LBF/reversal values remain illustrative until unit-specific Ariel performance/cylinder data are supplied.</div>';
